LOAN AGREEMENT

This LOAN AGREEMENT ("Agreement") is entered into on January 14, 2021, by and between:

1.1. BLUE OCEAN INCORPORATED, a corporation organized and existing under the laws of the State of Delaware, having its principal place of business at 123 Main Street, Wilmington, Delaware 19801 (the "Parent Company");

1.2. BLUE OCEAN HOLDINGS LIMITED, a limited company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales, having its registered office at 456 High Street, London EC1V 8PN, England and Wales (the "Holdings Company");

1.3. BLUE OCEAN FINANCE LIMITED, a limited company incorporated under the laws of Ireland, having its registered office at 789 Abbey Road, Dublin 4, Ireland (the "Finance Company"); and

1.4. BLUE OCEAN SUBSIDIARY LLC, a limited liability company organized and existing under the laws of the State of Delaware, having its principal place of business at 123 Main Street, Wilmington, Delaware 19801 (the "Subsidiary") (collectively, the "Borrowers").

2.1. CREDIT SUISSE AG, a bank and trust company organized and existing under the laws of Switzerland, having its principal place of business at Paradeplatz 8, 8001 Zurich, Switzerland (the "Lender").

WHEREAS, the Borrowers desire to borrow certain funds from the Lender; and

WHEREAS, the Lender is willing to lend such funds to the Borrowers upon the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement.

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants and promises contained herein, the parties agree as follows:

**LOAN TERMS**

2. The Lender agrees to lend to the Borrowers the sum of $50,000,000 (the "Loan Amount") on the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement.

3. The Loan Amount shall be disbursed in two tranches: $25,000,000 on the date of this Agreement and $25,000,000 on June 30, 2021.

4. The Borrowers shall use the Loan Amount to finance the acquisition of a majority interest in XYZ Corporation, a private company incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware.

**INTEREST AND FEES**

5. The Borrowers shall pay to the Lender interest on the outstanding principal amount of the Loan Amount at a rate of 4.50% per annum, calculated on a daily basis and accrued on the last day of each month.

6. The Borrowers shall pay to the Lender a commitment fee of 0.25% per annum on the Loan Amount, calculated on a daily basis and accrued on the last day of each month.

7. The Borrowers shall pay to the Lender a late payment fee of 2.00% per annum on any overdue payment, calculated on a daily basis and accrued on the last day of each month.

**DEFAULT AND REMEDIES**

8. If any of the Borrowers fail to comply with any of the terms and conditions of this Agreement, the Lender may, at its discretion, exercise one or more of the following remedies:

8.1. Demand immediate repayment of the outstanding principal amount of the Loan Amount;

8.2. Suspend disbursement of any further amounts under this Agreement;

8.3. Declare the entire principal amount of the Loan Amount immediately due and payable;

8.4. Accelerate the maturity of this Agreement;

8.5. Exercise any other rights or remedies available to the Lender under applicable law.

**SIGNATURES**

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Agreement as of the date first above written.

